<title>SINGAPORE: Inchcape sees better results.</title>
<headline>Inchcape sees better results.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading based Inchcape Bhd Ltd said on Monday it expected to improve on its results achieved in 1996.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement accompanying its 1996 results that release of more car quotas in Singapore would help the performance of its motor division.</p>
<p>Inchcape is the agent for Toyota and Suzuki cars.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
